    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9707" root="حيد" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَيْدَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَيْدٌ</span>, in three places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also The
<i>rugged part</i> of a road. (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>An evil look,</i>
(A, K,) <i>with a turning aside.</i> (A.) You say,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا نَظَرَ إِلَىَّ إِلَّا الحَيْدَةَ</span>, (A,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِلَّا نَظَرَ الحَيْدَةِ</span>,
(TA,) <i>He looked not towards me save with an
evil look, with a turning aside.</i> (A, TA.)

